{
	chapter.393DEBB437E296FE.title: "The Golden Path"
	chapter.4C1F0CC45B0D196D.title: "Welcome to Progress!"
	chapter.53CBA25E50CF4078.title: "Shitsco Inc. Gift Shop"
	chapter.559D567222C22387.title: "A New Product?"
	quest.004EE8414E180D76.quest_desc: [
		"This handy doodad provides the conduit power effect on demand in an automation-friendly way. "
		"We can also use it to mass produce prismarine, revive dead coral, and generate other normally difficult-to-find oceanic resources!"
	]
	quest.004EE8414E180D76.quest_subtitle: "We have conduits at home"
	quest.00DD758AD3BC9610.title: "Rare Ink"
	quest.027511486FEDEE04.title: "Lapis"
	quest.0372BFA6399F618C.quest_desc: [
		"Flight!"
		"Very slow, exhausting flight, but flight! Runs on pedal power."
	]
	quest.0501F5168C799EC7.quest_desc: ["Bring the Ancient Battleground to your front door, and battle several Ancient Knights."]
	quest.0501F5168C799EC7.quest_subtitle: "Fight Ancient Knights"
	quest.0501F5168C799EC7.title: "Broken Bulwarks"
	quest.05426729975FECA9.quest_desc: ["A memory of endless battle."]
	quest.05967D6226EBE475.title: "Gold Ingots"
	quest.068CDB428B6031C7.quest_desc: ["I can't read this junk. Guess that's why I'm the shopkeeper and you're the captain of industry, eh?"]
	quest.068CDB428B6031C7.title: "Runic Tablet"
	quest.06A6C66A6BB524A6.title: "Bombegranate"
	quest.07DF2B793D0A024E.quest_desc: ["Oh, I know a guy who loves this kinda thing. Give me his fee and I'll have him translate it for you."]
	quest.07DF2B793D0A024E.title: "Translate Logbook"
	quest.08B9AA53527D8EAA.quest_desc: ["I mean if it were me I would simply not die. "]
	quest.08B9AA53527D8EAA.title: "Totem of Undying"
	quest.08DA39FECC33199E.quest_desc: ["A one-off bounty."]
	quest.0A58BB7B68817F3D.quest_desc: [
		"Gateways to Eternity challenges you with waves of combat against many foes. Quality spoils go to the victor!"
		""
		"Shitsco Inc. is also always in need of more combat telemetry. Give those custom gateways a try, and earn more company scrip!"
		"Check the gift shop to begin."
	]
	quest.0A58BB7B68817F3D.title: "I like movies about gladiators, actually"
	quest.0A5944C9562CA024.title: "Gunpowder"
	quest.0BBB56AFEA550389.title: "Red Panda"
	quest.0C2B9A355FABA272.title: "Chunk Loader #2"
	quest.0CCBA298E3747D8C.quest_desc: ["Break these to get random seeds from Pam's Harvestcraft. Collect them all!"]
	quest.0CCBA298E3747D8C.title: "Pam's Crops Blind Box Series 1"
	quest.0CD6B03BE3E2A9EA.quest_desc: ["A memory of loss and emptiness."]
	quest.0D89825346A5FB9C.quest_desc: ["I think we can surpass the Meat Ingot with something like this..."]
	quest.0DCAA6BAAF51E65C.quest_desc: ["A one-off bounty."]
	quest.0DE37DA415D5B821.quest_desc: ["You must really need this stuff!"]
	quest.0DE37DA415D5B821.title: "Legendary Ink"
	quest.0DF7BAC2DC2C59B6.quest_desc: ["Legend tells of a powerful mage, able to replicate the functions of a well-run Create factory, using only their spells and spell turrets. That could be you!"]
	quest.0DF7BAC2DC2C59B6.title: "Tech without Tech"
	quest.10678A224A89A98B.title: "Cod"
	quest.1097D8D5A533B802.title: "Rabbit"
	quest.1264763735217006.title: "Wither Skull"
	quest.12FF20D0BDFE4FF9.quest_desc: [
		"Challenge the Dead King in a rite of succession. Familiar foes bar your path to the crown!"
		""
		"Not for the faint of heart!"
	]
	quest.12FF20D0BDFE4FF9.quest_subtitle: "Fight The Dead King"
	quest.12FF20D0BDFE4FF9.title: "The Dead King"
	quest.140BBEEC59B45BEA.quest_desc: ["Purchasing this will grant you one (1) additional Charm slot. Don't ask how we do it. You don't wanna know."]
	quest.140BBEEC59B45BEA.title: "Extra Charm Slot"
	quest.15D33105A1FAFB32.title: "Random T3 Glyph"
	quest.15EA7AD9581737D7.quest_desc: [
		"Similar to ore veins, hidden across the world, deep under bedrock, are rich oil veins waiting to be tapped!"
		"Use the oil scanner to prospect for oil deposits, then assemble the pumpjack contraption to drink deep!"
		""
		"Oil should be relatively common in all parts of the world, with deserts yielding more. If you've stumbled upon Oritech oil spouts, it can also be used for refining plastic and fuel."
	]
	quest.15EA7AD9581737D7.title: "Black Gold!"
	quest.15F5900580C392D8.title: "Emeralds"
	quest.1621D57CC224A3B1.quest_desc: [
		"Thanks to the power of plastic, we can now make truly space age machinery, all powered by electricity!"
		""
		"Note that you'll need to track down a Rare Metals vein to get the nickel and platinum you'll need to get farther with Oritech."
		""
		"Most Oritech machines are multiblocks, using one of multiple tiers of machine frames to build. Place down a machine block, then right click it with machine frames until the fully formed machine springs to life. "
	]
	quest.1621D57CC224A3B1.title: "Oritech"
	quest.166A2CD2DB738363.quest_desc: [
		"Did somebody beat you to the preservation chamber? I've got the solution."
		"Don't know what this is? Come back when you're a little more colorful, kid."
	]
	quest.166A2CD2DB738363.title: "Jade Vine"
	quest.167B0AF56006DEB4.title: "Ferret"
	quest.16E23414E0BC346E.quest_desc: ["Place this down and select a trade quest, and you can automatically (and repeatedly) complete that trade by piping in items!"]
	quest.16E23414E0BC346E.title: "Automated Commerce"
	quest.17B6962B8F39C9D1.quest_desc: ["Is... this legal?"]
	quest.17BA40A2EB61DA4C.quest_desc: [
		"Hi, Peter Olle here."
		""
		"I always knew you could do it. While all my assistants blathered on about \"capturing market share\", and \"not spending millions on getting designer cookies delivered\", I knew. I knew that you had the cutthroat business sense that would lead us to inventing the same thing we already had, but a little bit better. And it's exactly what we needed."
		""
		"This company might not be in the clear just yet, but once I get done defeating every other member of the board in ritualistic single combat and claiming their neckties in glorious victory, I know EXACTLY who I'm calling to replace one of them. "
		""
		"And if they turn the job down, well buddy, you've got the fast track to the second round of interviews."
		""
		"I love you."
		""
		"Peter Olle"
		"Shitsco Inc CEO"
	]
	quest.17BA40A2EB61DA4C.title: "A thank you from our CEO"
	quest.181EB398B0AC213F.quest_desc: ["A memory of decadence, and self-actualization."]
	quest.18F14BF265A617CB.quest_desc: [
		"Ah, the humble Meat Ingot. Jewel in the crown of the Shitsco Inc. empire, and beloved by all."
		""
		"Before we get into developing new products, make sure you have a good appreciation for our star offering first and make a production line for it."
		""
		"Once they've gone through, uh, quality assurance, I'll return them to you. After that, you'll need to do some research."
	]
	quest.190D809C950E54C3.quest_desc: ["Lose your terminal? Or just want more to decorate your home with? We've got you covered."]
	quest.190D809C950E54C3.title: "Additional Bank Terminals"
	quest.1978A410E9164E64.quest_desc: [
		"Just take your wizard hat and go."
		""
		"Iron's Spells and Spellbooks focuses on combat spells-- lots of them! Find them as loot on scrolls (or write your own), then stick 'em in a spellbook or inscribe them onto your gear. "
	]
	quest.1978A410E9164E64.title: "Some kind of secret third wizard"
	quest.19FB47E82B88A57A.title: "Topaz"
	quest.1B4E8A1F18BB31A8.quest_desc: ["Alright pal, I'm cutting you off. I don't care where you go, but you can't load here."]
	quest.1B4E8A1F18BB31A8.title: "Chunk Loader #8"
	quest.1B6446EF6A056FCB.title: "Arrows"
	quest.1BAC7AF9AE9DA2F2.quest_desc: ["A memory of new beginnings, after tragedy."]
	quest.1CE4D718F1230C93.quest_desc: ["How did I get all these? Life, uh, finds a way."]
	quest.1CE4D718F1230C93.title: "Dragon Egg"
	quest.1D35E81B7033CB6C.quest_desc: [
		"By making andesite alloy, and taking your first steps into Create, you have entered the Andesite Age!"
		"It's... not much different from before. But you should be able to start on some simple automation and farming!"
	]
	quest.1D35E81B7033CB6C.title: "The Andesite Age"
	quest.1D54E5E8101DBAF0.quest_desc: ["Contains a random assortment of eight fruit-bearing saplings from Croptopia. Collect them all!"]
	quest.1D54E5E8101DBAF0.title: "Croptopia Saplings Blind Box Series 1"
	quest.1EC5181D4C105708.title: "Zinc Ingots"
	quest.1EF62D1D5CDC802D.title: "Chunk Loader #6"
	quest.1FED454D1B19AAAB.quest_desc: ["Contains a random assortment of 8 Series 1 Croptopia seeds, from Leek to Zucchini. (L through Z) Collect them all!"]
	quest.1FED454D1B19AAAB.title: "Croptopia Seeds Blind Box Series 2"
	quest.2063F329CA8E58FC.title: "Bastion Fruit"
	quest.222243FD20EA0685.title: "Axolotl"
	quest.22CCF136380DD068.quest_desc: [
		"Scientists claim the average employee has up to ten fingers. Why are we limiting ourselves to using two? "
		""
		"Will grant you an additional Ring curio slot, once only."
	]
	quest.22CCF136380DD068.title: "Extra Ring Slot"
	quest.237A5FF4D855FC29.quest_desc: [
		"You've built a massive factory. Trains roll in carrying tons of raw ore and brimming tanks of oil every minute. The factory is veering uncomfortably closely to sentience and is going to ask for a raise any minute. Now what?"
		""
		"It is time to do some market research. We have a company to save."
	]
	quest.237A5FF4D855FC29.title: "Now what?"
	quest.23A65C96836E8A26.quest_desc: [
		"He's had it too good for too long. Back to work!"
		""
		"Turn those starbuncles into productive workers. The starbuncle wheel produces constant (but low stress capacity) rotational force, with a very small footprint. Is it ethical? Sure!"
	]
	quest.23E5801EBEF2756D.quest_desc: [
		"The travel method of the future*!"
		""
		"Simply power the entrance, and lay the tubes along the path you'd like to travel. Then hop on in, and be whisked away via the hypertubes!"
		""
		""
		""
		"*Future not guaranteed. You signed a safety waiver already."
	]
	quest.23E5801EBEF2756D.title: "Hypertubes"
	quest.241BF6138349B0A1.quest_desc: ["Create has a steam-powered whistle already. But what if you could turn that into a massive, mighty pipe organ? No vampire castle is complete without one."]
	quest.241BF6138349B0A1.title: "A Mighty Toot"
	quest.251AFF09D07A6D71.title: "Citrine"
	quest.254C726B5CD2C7F4.quest_desc: [
		"Finally! A big window with all your stuff in it, that you can craft from!"
		""
		"Wireless will have to wait, as will more complex automation. "
	]
	quest.254C726B5CD2C7F4.title: "Tom's Crafting Terminal"
	quest.269398F06F8D7FB8.title: "Fox"
	quest.26A9E77FC537B616.quest_desc: [
		"These aren't craftable by normal means. Luckily the Shitsco Inc. warehouse is well stocked!"
		""
		"Note that teleportation isn't free-- long distance teleports cost Cogs."
	]
	quest.26A9E77FC537B616.title: "Waystone"
	quest.271978BF0F72974D.quest_desc: [
		"Fine!! Ugh!!"
		""
		"Malum seems to still be a work in progress, but it features some pretty effects, interesting alchemy, and personal enchantments. Great for the Thaumcraft diehards."
	]
	quest.271978BF0F72974D.title: "I'm more of a witch than wizard, honestly"
	quest.2753D7E34181047B.quest_desc: ["It's your standard-issue hammer-- it mines in a 3x3, all at once. Great for strip mining or redecorating a cave."]
	quest.2753D7E34181047B.title: "Power Mining"
	quest.28785B979C08086F.quest_desc: ["Using a source condenser will turn source (jarred) into source (actual fluid). You can then store it in tanks, pipe it around, and even fill your swimming pool with it!"]
	quest.28785B979C08086F.title: "Swimming in Source"
	quest.28D3509133F2D55C.quest_desc: [
		"As an employee of Shitsco Inc., you are privy to an advanced trackmaking technique, which means tracks are even cheaper to make in bulk than normal!"
		""
		"Additionally, try the track layer's bag-- it can contain an unconscionable amount of tracks in one inventory slot, which should make long routes easy to lay."
	]
	quest.28D3509133F2D55C.title: "Train Tracks"
	quest.28FE831DAF20E6AD.title: "Leaf Insect"
	quest.294211B3405EFBCF.title: "Rotten Flesh"
	quest.2962B2B7DEAB2522.title: "Spider Eyes"
	quest.297384CA939735AF.quest_desc: ["A memory of hubris and timely intervention."]
	quest.29AD94309E1D0663.quest_desc: [
		"Too many mod manuals clogging your inventory already? The Akashic Tome has the solution."
		""
		"Craft it together with a mod's book and it'll be stored in the tome. You can select it later to read it in place."
	]
	quest.29AD94309E1D0663.quest_subtitle: "If I see one more book..."
	quest.29AD94309E1D0663.title: "Akashic Tome"
	quest.29ADB74079C1080C.quest_desc: ["Consider Functional Storage for your classic drawers experience. Note the upgrades that multiply the amount of items held in a drawer."]
	quest.29ADB74079C1080C.title: "Drawers and Mass Storage"
	quest.2A9B0219672CA328.title: "Horse"
	quest.2BEF619839842668.quest_desc: [
		"There are a few key ore vein types to know about! Search @progress in EMI, and look for the drill icon to see exact outputs and ratios."
		""
		"&lOverworld Veins&r"
		"* Common Minerals"
		"    Contains iron, copper, zinc, and coal."
		"* Rare Metals"
		"    Contains gold, silver, nickel, yellorite, and platinum."
		"* Precious Gems"
		"    Contains redstone, lapis lazuli, diamonds, and emeralds."
		""
		"&lNether Veins&r"
		"* Hellish Hoard"
		"    Contains quartz, glowstone dust, meat pulp (a lot of meat pulp), and rarely ancient debris."
		"* Marbled Mess"
		"    Contains meat. Lots of meat. No, more than that. Pink slime needs to be piped into the drill to work."
		""
		"&lEnd Veins&r"
		"* Lunar Lode"
		"    Contains ender pearls and dragon breath. Pink slime needs to be piped into the drill to work."
	]
	quest.2BEF619839842668.title: "Ore Veins and You"
	quest.2CA14A5AB1776BED.quest_desc: [
		"Fluid drawers work like a normal drawer, but for fluids. Seems reasonable! "
		"Punch 'em with a bucket to withdraw, right click with a bucket of fluid to deposit."
		""
		"But that's not all! With either of these upgrades the fluid drawer can be made to produce lava or water, for free, forever. It's as useful as it sounds!"
	]
	quest.2CA14A5AB1776BED.title: "Fluids for Nothin'"
	quest.2CA6B073DCE3C2A2.title: "Chickens"
	quest.2CEBACC62130B386.title: "Ocelot"
	quest.2E35A4B1EB1026B5.quest_desc: ["That dinky tome is no good. I can patch it up for you four times as good, no problem."]
	quest.2E35A4B1EB1026B5.title: "Upgrade Tome of Scrapping"
	quest.2EAB75B88162FF17.quest_desc: [
		"By forging your first ingots of brass, you have entered into the Brass Age!"
		"New, stronger, and more precise machines are available to you. Notably, Tom's Simple Storage and its crafting terminal are now accessible."
		""
		"But to go further, we're going to need something tougher..."
	]
	quest.2EAB75B88162FF17.title: "The Brass Age"
	quest.2F881D31F4F35F7E.title: "Flashpine"
	quest.2FAD76CECF8CA6A2.title: "Otter"
	quest.3058789CA946BE1C.quest_desc: [
		"Far and away the most useful item in Create. Use the hotkey to access a radial menu of the contents of nearby toolboxes, and then quickly put them all back. "
		"Great for building stuff other than contraptions too!"
	]
	quest.3058789CA946BE1C.title: "Toolbox"
	quest.3095FC8B396456E1.quest_desc: ["Allows access to the Osseous Ordeal, ending with a dance with a Mutant Skeleton."]
	quest.3095FC8B396456E1.quest_subtitle: "Fight Skeletons"
	quest.3095FC8B396456E1.title: "Osseous Ordeal"
	quest.30DF951992876BD4.quest_desc: ["Contains a random assortment of 8 Series 1 Croptopia seeds, from Asparagus to Kiwi. (A through K) Collect them all!"]
	quest.30DF951992876BD4.title: "Croptopia Seeds Blind Box Series 1"
	quest.324BB3A15E6355D6.quest_desc: [
		"Fine! Go play with Occultism and summon some demons to be your friends instead."
		""
		"Occultism features a neat system for conducting ritual spells using chalk runes in a magic circle, and plenty of candles. Do things right and you can summon and bind demons to do your homework for you."
	]
	quest.324BB3A15E6355D6.title: "No, a different kind of wizard"
	quest.32704612E32A14C2.quest_desc: [
		"Fine, don't build a factory. Go be a wizard instead. I'll just put all this hard work in the garbage because you want to wear a robe with some stars on it."
		""
		"Ars Nouvea is a magic mod themed around custom spells and some light arcane engineering. We've included plenty of addons to bridge Ars into Create and other mods, so there might be some clever shortcuts and workarounds to the normal progression if you're willing to learn some magic!"
	]
	quest.32704612E32A14C2.title: "I wanna be a wizard instead"
	quest.3327F712C5AF64E6.title: "Quartz"
	quest.33358F23A4A20788.quest_desc: [
		"You've got a lot more wrist than Big Bracelet would have you believe. Let's unlock that potential!"
		""
		"Will grant you an additional Bracelet curio slot, once only."
	]
	quest.33358F23A4A20788.title: "Extra Bracelet Slot"
	quest.344127E1349201AA.title: "Frog"
	quest.34F30E0BA8E8595B.title: "Parrot"
	quest.35B845AD44CBAE44.quest_desc: [
		"WARNING! Clicking submit will grab every item it can find out of your inventory (ignoring equipped items). Make sure you ONLY have items you want to sell in your pockets!"
		""
		"Piping items into a Task Screen (see purchase details below) might also be a good option!"
	]
	quest.35B845AD44CBAE44.title: "Sell Enchanted Books"
	quest.369130352EE2E478.quest_desc: [
		"WARNING! Clicking submit will grab every item it can find out of your inventory (ignoring equipped items). Make sure you ONLY have items you want to sell in your pockets!"
		""
		"Piping items into a Task Screen (see purchase details below) might also be a good option!"
	]
	quest.369130352EE2E478.title: "Sell Music Discs"
	quest.3693F41B3E29E318.quest_desc: [
		"You know what they say, many hands make something something. "
		""
		"Will grant you an additional Hands curio slot, once only."
	]
	quest.3693F41B3E29E318.title: "Extra Hands Slot"
	quest.3730E6E7D00142A3.title: "Blaze Rods"
	quest.377952517F4023A2.title: "Buy Saplings"
	quest.37F7E40098E5EC7E.title: "Iron Ingots"
	quest.3843D2D38F7DF7D2.title: "Buy Cobblestones"
	quest.3878B4A831331BC9.title: "Emergency Rations"
	quest.3887966579D471FB.title: "Shima Enaga"
	quest.39183BEC41250339.title: "Common Ink"
	quest.3989ABD633FBA3C6.quest_desc: ["Feeding blaze burners by hand is a pain. Give them a straw and they can be powered by piping in fluid like lava (or later, oil-based fuels) directly!"]
	quest.39A9C7224CC167E5.title: "Chunk Loader #4"
	quest.3A16BF72490338CF.quest_desc: [
		"For a nominal* fee, Shitsco Inc. Adjustors will scour the world for loot chests you've previously opened, and restock them just for you! Wow!!"
		""
		""
		"* Fee may not be nominal. Caveat emptor."
	]
	quest.3A16BF72490338CF.title: "Loot Chest Refresh"
	quest.3AC89B4503946EE9.quest_desc: ["All your hard work has paid off. All your tears and sweat have led to this-- a tastier brick of pure meat, imbued with the accumulated knowledge of a decade of progress."]
	quest.3B4AAD068B362C84.title: "Cows"
	quest.3BF44B6E9A2ADD1E.quest_desc: ["Don't forget you can copy templates using diamonds!"]
	quest.3BF44B6E9A2ADD1E.title: "Blaze Upgrade Template"
	quest.3BFAAF1C57C950E3.quest_desc: ["For nefarious purposes only."]
	quest.3BFAAF1C57C950E3.title: "Summon Blaze"
	quest.3C802B1A9461519D.quest_desc: [
		"At last!"
		"By the power of plastic, Applied Energistics 2 is fully unlocked. Fire your stock keeper! Replace them with a computer! It's not a bubble!"
	]
	quest.3C802B1A9461519D.title: "Applied Energistics"
	quest.3CF962B292F383C9.title: "Epic Ink"
	quest.3DD0F4C7AD7A2942.quest_desc: [
		"The Stock Link is Create's answer to Applied Energistics. It's a potent and cheap way to view and access all your items. Try Pondering the item to get started!"
		""
		"Vaults make for good bulk storage using this system!"
		""
		"Looking for a good stock keeper? Check the Gift Shop chapter!"
	]
	quest.3DD0F4C7AD7A2942.title: "The Stock Link System"
	quest.3F3867E0DF494034.quest_desc: ["No longer are we restrained by the tyranny of having to catch fish by hand with a pole, like a caveman. Now you can make a big doohickey that swings a thing into the water to grab the fish and then catapult them to shore, like a true citizen of the 21st century."]
	quest.3F3867E0DF494034.title: "Fishing Creatively"
	quest.3F92D42B31166CF4.quest_desc: ["Don't forget you can copy templates using diamonds!"]
	quest.3F92D42B31166CF4.title: "Netherite Upgrade Template"
	quest.3FD3B450642D341D.quest_desc: [
		"You know the drill. You're going to need a base of operations, so hop to it!"
		""
		"This book is not going to be teaching you how each mod works. I'll mostly be signposting important milestones, new capabilities that unlock for your base, and useful items or mods to know about as you build up."
	]
	quest.3FD3B450642D341D.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.41C4C2A15F89AA97.quest_desc: [
		"In case your blocky arteries weren't clogged enough. "
		"Plenty of new food recipes are available to you now, empowered by the unholy might of deep frying."
	]
	quest.41C4C2A15F89AA97.title: "Deep Fryin'"
	quest.428F32FBD562BC2A.title: "Sheep"
	quest.451A656D5CE674C6.quest_desc: [
		"Jetpacks! The other travel method of the future!"
		""
		"These are water powered, and can't really get too high off the ground. But they should still be useful for building! You're just not Iron Man yet."
		""
		"Each of the variants has different fueling requirements. Brass and Netherite can travel higher than the andesite or copper versions."
	]
	quest.451A656D5CE674C6.title: "Jetpacks"
	quest.45DB950A2B094F7B.quest_desc: [
		"Finally, a component strong enough to withstand some heavy industry!"
		""
		"Sturdy sheets enable trains and all their associated infrastructure. "
		""
		"Additionally, ore excavation and oil drilling are now possible in chunks all across the world. Get to prospecting and stake your claim!"
	]
	quest.45DB950A2B094F7B.title: "The Sturdy Age"
	quest.4707465639A1F3EA.quest_desc: [
		"What do you do once you've struck oil? Distill it, and either burn it as diesel fuel, or further refine it into plastic!"
		""
		"Note that when looking at fluid recipes for some Create machines, they may only register as outputs and not ingredients. Try both if you're not seeing a use for a fluid like oil or diesel."
	]
	quest.4707465639A1F3EA.title: "Oil Processing"
	quest.47A7D2F8216F9962.quest_desc: [
		"Shitsco Inc. is, regrettably, not the only game in town."
		"The Market block allows you to exchange emeralds and diamonds for various crops, saplings, and other useful doodads. Can't find the tree you like? Need a warped fungus like, yesterday? Check the market!"
	]
	quest.47A7D2F8216F9962.title: "The freer the markets..."
	quest.47BA16EF57428B75.title: "Buy Stones"
	quest.4875191BA094C540.quest_desc: [
		"Everything you need to get a basic storage system going. Ponder the Stock Ticker for details and an example."
		""
		"You'll need to hire your own stock keeper though! Might I suggest the pet shop to the right?"
	]
	quest.4875191BA094C540.title: "Stock Link Starter Kit"
	quest.49A7D6AB16D9F8FF.quest_desc: ["A memory of innocence and levity."]
	quest.49F95EA0AEDF98F7.title: "Random Epic Hat"
	quest.4BC61344FA771DC0.quest_desc: [
		"Now, to get it to market!"
		"If we're gonna save Shitsco Inc., we're going to need a lot of these things, and fast!"
		""
		"Succeed, and you'll have the company's undying gratitude*"
		""
		""
		""
		""
		""
		"*Gratitude only valid in the state of AR, MO, and NE. Conditions apply."
	]
	quest.4BC61344FA771DC0.title: "Scaling Up"
	quest.4C27F0F6471109BC.quest_desc: [
		"Pastel offers a unique kind of exploration and experience-based progression system, and very unique and polished color-based magic!"
		"Spectrum primarily works through Advancements. Plenty of new magical items are hiding in the world in plain sight already!"
		""
		"Just... be careful. We don't want another repeat of The Great Shitsco Dirt Disaster."
	]
	quest.4C27F0F6471109BC.quest_subtitle: "The artist formerly known as Spectrum"
	quest.4C27F0F6471109BC.title: "There may be too many kinds of wizard to be"
	quest.4D123A4C51A29D71.title: "Armadillo"
	quest.4D17B77855F9C02A.title: "Pigs"
	quest.4D601AE2A3E8261C.quest_desc: [
		"Plastic!"
		"It's a magical material. All kinds of advanced technology lies at your fingertips, now that you have a sufficiently ocean-ruining material at your beck and call."
		""
		"Oritech, Applied Energistics 2, Extreme Reactors, and Hostile Neural Networks are all available now! But what will you make, now that you have something this powerful?"
	]
	quest.4D601AE2A3E8261C.title: "The Plastic Age"
	quest.4D876C47978157EB.quest_desc: [
		"Throughout your work here with Shitsco Inc., you'll be periodically rewarded with Cogs, our new company currency, that's better than any of those ugly fiat currencies you might already be familiar with!"
		""
		"Any currency you acquire can be stored in this bank terminal. It'll even make change for you!"
		""
		"Additional opportunities to earn more currency can be found in this chapter."
		"Our employee incentive program also provides a way to trade this currency for materials, in case you need a boost!"
		""
		"Finally, in the spirit of continuous never-ending improvement, all employees are encouraged to trade with one another using this currency! Create provides a trade system by reusing the stock link system, and Create:Numismatics also provides a Vendor block."
	]
	quest.4D876C47978157EB.title: "Money: A How To Guide"
	quest.4E3DADD77882A076.quest_desc: [
		"Grants an audience with the Volatile Battalion, building up to a battle with a Mutant Creeper."
		""
		"* WARNING: May have explosive results! Begin this challenge in a fortified area."
	]
	quest.4E3DADD77882A076.quest_subtitle: "Fight Creepers"
	quest.4E3DADD77882A076.title: "Volatile Battalion"
	quest.4F005428436CFC7D.quest_desc: [
		"All ender chests obtained from this trade are linked together, even across other players."
		"Need to work out a quick deal? Ask around! Just don't lose it-- you won't be able to buy another one!"
	]
	quest.4F005428436CFC7D.title: "Black Market Box"
	quest.4F4D448AEFF9BF3D.quest_desc: ["A memory of consistent self-improvement."]
	quest.4FE06542E069EDF0.quest_desc: [
		"It's alive!"
		""
		"By brewing up specialized spawning fluids, the Mechanical Spawner can spawn creatures for your nefarious purposes. Just once, maybe spawn something as a friend instead of as grist?"
	]
	quest.501DD3E67923F2E5.title: "String"
	quest.512A276814138528.title: "Emergency Defenses"
	quest.514C17AA13A0768F.title: "Soulstone"
	quest.515E1ABEAA363D2A.quest_desc: [
		"WARNING! Clicking submit will grab every item it can find out of your inventory (ignoring equipped items). Make sure you ONLY have items you want to sell in your pockets!"
		""
		"Piping items into a Task Screen (see purchase details below) might also be a good option!"
	]
	quest.515E1ABEAA363D2A.title: "Sell Spare Artifacts and Relics"
	quest.5339790945A2B356.quest_desc: ["It's a crafting table, on a stick. You can put it in a curio slot, and use a full size crafting table anywhere with a keybind (V by default)!"]
	quest.5339790945A2B356.title: "Portable Crafting"
	quest.5395390EB690C3B9.title: "Amethyst"
	quest.53A8C337EC1AC30D.title: "Copper Ingots"
	quest.53FAD21C31399E57.quest_desc: [
		"I know what you want."
		"You want to make a big sandwich. You want to take a stack of bread, and a stack of salami, and shuffle it together like a big deck of cards."
	]
	quest.53FAD21C31399E57.title: "A Big Sandwich"
	quest.5424189ABDA95F7F.quest_desc: ["You might need this stuff to get going!"]
	quest.5424189ABDA95F7F.title: "Buy Andesite"
	quest.54618EC7223BE0D3.title: "Diamonds"
	quest.54F5FA97CFA2097D.quest_desc: ["The Shitsco Preferred(tm) way of making a few eggs, to crack an omelette. Or something."]
	quest.55482F5D25732333.title: "Random T1 Glyph"
	quest.55AED027B29EBAD1.quest_desc: ["A memory of grace under pressure."]
	quest.55DA3004424E78EF.title: "Random Common Hat"
	quest.568BD3C58CE2A6A8.quest_desc: ["Useful tools for building and replacing blocks. They need power, and we won't be able to produce much electricity yet (not that we'll need to). But a simple alternator should do!"]
	quest.568BD3C58CE2A6A8.title: "Building Gadgets"
	quest.57AA0483059CCC6C.quest_desc: ["Permits challenging the Relentless Regiment, led by a Mutant Zombie."]
	quest.57AA0483059CCC6C.quest_subtitle: "Fight Zombies"
	quest.57AA0483059CCC6C.title: "Relentless Regiment"
	quest.584CFFE07FF47CF5.quest_desc: [
		"Certainly! Here's a heartfelt welcome letter you can provide to your new employees."
		""
		"Welcome, <NAME OF NEW EMPLOYEE>! We're thrilled you've chosen to join the Shitsco Inc. family. "
		"We're excited to welcome you to the fast-paced world of procuring and producing the high-end products that the Shitsco Inc. brand has come to be known for, and invite you to complete the following new employee orientation courses:"
		""
		"1. An Adventure in Andesite"
		"2. Advanced Applications of Brass"
		"3. Sturdy Sheets for Sturdy Stuff"
		"4. Plastics and You: A Polyethylene Pilgrimage"
		"5. Currency: What is it, and Why?"
		"6. Meat"
		""
		"Completing these courses won't just be an educational experience-- it'll be vital to your success as a top-ranking associate of Shitsco Inc.!"
		""
		"Warmest Regards,"
		""
		"Peter Olle"
		"Shitsco Inc. CEO"
	]
	quest.584CFFE07FF47CF5.title: "A personal note from our CEO"
	quest.5943DA67C4781D39.quest_desc: [
		"But what do we do with all this power? It's got to go somewhere!"
		"Finally, the answer is here: we boil the oceans in order to simulate the rich inner life of a zombie, then reap the drops!"
		""
		"Using large amounts of power (and some starting model data gathered in the field), we can retire the old mob grinder and replace it with a machine that spits out monster loot directly!"
	]
	quest.5943DA67C4781D39.title: "Hostile Neural Networks"
	quest.59EA3605E3B0F4C0.title: "Ender Pearls"
	quest.5AFB2B4B0E2BCA96.quest_desc: [
		"Now that we have a sufficiently sturdy material to contain the wifi demons, we can start adding wireless access to Tom's Simple Storage setups."
		""
		"The base wireless terminal just allows you to stand further away from your terminals (while still looking at them!), but the advanced terminal works how you might expect."
	]
	quest.5AFB2B4B0E2BCA96.title: "The Return of Tom"
	quest.5C215B4EC8EB2210.quest_desc: [
		"You might've noticed some extra-mean monsters roaming around the world, with funny names. These are Apotheosis invaders! And to take them out we're going to need some better gear."
		""
		"Weapons and armor now drop with affixes and rarities, which add extra stats and abilities to any piece of gear. You can salvage that gear to get rarity materials, which you can use at the reforging table to add affixes to any piece of gear!"
		""
		"In order to get better loot, you'll want to increase your world tier (press ctrl+T). This will improve your loot, but also make the monsters stronger... be careful! You can lower your tier at any time."
	]
	quest.5C215B4EC8EB2210.title: "Apotheosis"
	quest.5C873D4617706DE8.quest_desc: ["Coal powered! Pretty speedy and surprisingly hard to crash. Take to the skies!"]
	quest.5D06D9E0B6E6F83F.quest_desc: [
		"My brother in law is a master chemist. He can whip you up some ice venom that's just as good* as the real thing!"
		""
		""
		""
		""
		"&o* May not be as good as the real thing. Terms and conditions apply. Ask your doctor if ice venom is right for you.&r"
	]
	quest.5D06D9E0B6E6F83F.title: "Ice Venom Vial"
	quest.5D0D0F6C38D9FE33.quest_desc: ["A memory of lasting consequences."]
	quest.5EC89E6933775D11.quest_desc: [
		"The enchantment library takes all the fuss out of organizing and storing your enchanted books. Any enchanted books you throw in will get converted to a point value for that enchantment. You can then freely pull out that enchantment using those points, up to the highest level of that enchant you've ever stored in the library."
		""
		"For example, if I put in four copies of Sharpness III, i'll have 16 points of sharpness that I can pull out in any combination (up to level III!). If I later put in a Sharpness IV book (or higher), I would then be able to use those 16 points to make Sharpness IV books!"
	]
	quest.5F46A03075A77660.quest_desc: ["A memory of applied science."]
	quest.5FCB1AC6BC775CD5.title: "Redstone Dust"
	quest.5FDB0542EF1B7833.quest_desc: [
		"Did you know that plastic is the greatest insulator we know of against radiation? Me neither! It's a good thing then that these reactors don't make any!"
		""
		"Extreme Reactors allow us to reach dizzying heights in power production, provided you can maintain it!"
	]
	quest.5FDB0542EF1B7833.title: "Extreme Reactors"
	quest.6013F4DFAC85D87A.quest_desc: ["Automate your cutting board. Cutting things by hand is for losers. You're not a loser... right?"]
	quest.605AD4D52BEF15C5.quest_desc: ["Coal powered! Useful as a stable building platform. I wouldn't use it for your morning commute."]
	quest.608D96C74B05CF8F.quest_desc: [
		"The Mechanical Extruder lets you produce various stones and useful materials, like a better cobble generator."
		"Keep an eye out for the brass upgrade later on!"
	]
	quest.610C127DB977B0AC.title: "Leather"
	quest.61FBFC5609FC86FE.quest_desc: ["Please don't drop it, it's very old!"]
	quest.61FBFC5609FC86FE.title: "Decorated Pots"
	quest.62347C2FD345A195.quest_desc: [
		"Sophisticated Backpacks will be our choice for backpacks and personal inventory."
		""
		"Don't settle for opening it by hand-- open the curios menu, equip it to the back slot, and then open it with the keybind! ('B' by default)"
		""
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/quest/backpack-tut.png width:169 height:143 align:center}"
		""
		""
		"Backpacks are upgradeable in-place to get more room, and more upgrade slots. (You don't need to empty the backpack before upgrading!)"
		""
		"Make sure to check out the upgrades-- they're quite useful! Some recommendations:"
		"* Stack size upgrades increase the amount you can hold in one slot"
		"* Compression and Pickup upgrades help with long mining trips"
		"* Stonecutter and Chipped workstation upgrades let you use those blocks on the go."
		"* Tank upgrades allow you to hold a good amount of fluids at the cost of some item space."
	]
	quest.62347C2FD345A195.title: "Personal Storage"
	quest.630003DC54334D5B.title: "Cinder Essence"
	quest.6356AC8CD8C5F6FA.quest_desc: [
		"Okay. How about this?"
		""
		"It's bees! But more like the vanilla-style bees and less like... those other bees."
		"Raise and breed ever-stranger types of bees to (slowly) produce nice resources for you, and look cute doing it."
		""
		"Advanced hives support upgrades. Please consider using the simulation upgrade if you want to run several hives at the same time!"
	]
	quest.6356AC8CD8C5F6FA.title: "I don't want to be a wizard at all, actually."
	quest.6365CC81E548CDEE.quest_desc: ["Keeps the enchanted item in your pockets when you beef it."]
	quest.6365CC81E548CDEE.title: "Soulbound Enchantment"
	quest.6390A19C5119981F.quest_desc: [
		"Having trouble finding these? I know a guy."
		"Don't know what this is? Come back when you're a little more colorful, kid."
	]
	quest.6390A19C5119981F.title: "Mermaid Gem"
	quest.639C0BA01EC2D9FB.title: "Jumping Spider"
	quest.64D3C3325ED93F1D.title: "Bees"
	quest.6625278D17436668.title: "Random Rare Hat"
	quest.66297436620EC79B.title: "Mendosteen"
	quest.67F4EB051E8DBDC7.quest_desc: ["It fell off a truck."]
	quest.67F4EB051E8DBDC7.title: "Player Head"
	quest.6848DB205D2197F5.title: "Arcane Essence"
	quest.68B95EB5E50AC1F7.quest_desc: ["What if the magic juice was in the computer?"]
	quest.68B95EB5E50AC1F7.title: "Magic Online"
	quest.6BBC2EEB210700C9.title: "Uncommon Ink"
	quest.6C3F077C0281E167.quest_desc: ["Using tools from our friends at Create Enchantment Industry will allow you to use liquid experience to fuel powerful enchanting contraptions!"]
	quest.6C3F077C0281E167.title: "Creative Enchanting"
	quest.6CCB7FC1C0BADBCA.title: "Chunk Loader #7"
	quest.6D11E69DB40AAEF0.quest_desc: [
		"Hidden across the world are deep ore veins, full of precious minerals to plunder! Ore veins are infinite but the exact chunk they lie in needs to be sniffed out."
		""
		"Use the ore vein finder to locate chunks where ore veins might be found. Keep an eye on your map-- it'll display a search radius for the vein mentioned in the chat window."
		""
		"Once you've found a vein, place the mining drill and power it to pull up the ores. The atlas can be used to easily mark veins you've found on your map, provided you take a sample first with a Sample Drill."
	]
	quest.6D11E69DB40AAEF0.title: "Ore Excavation"
	quest.6D564FDAF9C3E543.quest_desc: ["Purely decorative. These might not be in the world otherwise."]
	quest.6D564FDAF9C3E543.title: "Budding Opals"
	quest.6D8FDAB03BEBA881.quest_desc: [
		"If all you want is more hats, craft your excess hats with Shears to make hat loot bags instead!"
		""
		"WARNING! Clicking submit will grab every item it can find out of your inventory (ignoring equipped items). Make sure you ONLY have items you want to sell in your pockets!"
		""
		"Piping items into a Task Screen (see purchase details below) might also be a good option!"
	]
	quest.6D8FDAB03BEBA881.title: "Sell Hats"
	quest.6DEA619796607A43.title: "Buy Logs"
	quest.6FCEB307FB71B9AB.quest_desc: [
		"Working on a team? "
		"To share funds, create a Blaze Banker by using this banking guide on a blaze burner. Then, right click your banker (give him a name for ease of use), and place a card in the slot. "
		""
		"Once a card is bound to a banker, you can use it in the bank terminal to view the funds managed by that banker, and withdraw like normal."
	]
	quest.6FCEB307FB71B9AB.title: "Shared Accounts"
	quest.6FEC9AAE2AD67D79.quest_desc: [
		"Why are you looking at me like I've got two heads?"
		""
		"Will grant you an additional Head curio slot, once only."
	]
	quest.6FEC9AAE2AD67D79.title: "Extra Head Slot"
	quest.70F9C8DD54318E16.title: "Netherite Scraps"
	quest.721C11C33AFEE7DE.quest_desc: ["Coal powered! Also comes in a cargo variety if you need to migrate your base."]
	quest.727297B098007D13.quest_desc: [
		"Keeps those nosy neighbors at bay."
		"Once you've established your base, get a Mega Torch set up to block monster spawns nearby and keep your claim safe."
	]
	quest.727297B098007D13.title: "Frontier Friend"
	quest.72C5D765B0FFEF74.quest_desc: [
		"In limited quantities! Get yours now!"
		""
		"To fully unlock all features, you'll need to capture a Ghast."
	]
	quest.72C5D765B0FFEF74.title: "Chunk Loader #1"
	quest.7311BF01D5464CC3.quest_desc: ["A memory of determination, despite hardship."]
	quest.73812C14038AB287.title: "Chunk Loader #3"
	quest.7394954CBF3EDF31.title: "Random T2 Glyph"
	quest.74933F6EBAEF73C2.quest_desc: ["Sorry, I don't know why they're wet. Maybe wear gloves?"]
	quest.74933F6EBAEF73C2.title: "Sponges"
	quest.74FE29B2832D0AC1.title: "Frostaya"
	quest.774F6286442E547E.title: "Chunk Loader #5"
	quest.77A7DB7DAED2A18C.quest_desc: [
		"As a new employee of Shitsco Inc., you're entitled to the \"best\" gear in the business. "
		""
		"Redeem your coupon for one (1) free backpack here! "
		"Next we'll work on upgrading it for more space."
	]
	quest.77A7DB7DAED2A18C.title: "Free Backpack!"
	quest.78446E797B423DEF.quest_desc: ["That other guy with the tomes? Hack and a fraud. Gimme a tome he sold you and I can make 'em really shine. "]
	quest.78446E797B423DEF.title: "Upgrade Tome of Superior Scrapping"
	quest.791234BBD24277D8.quest_desc: ["For the mage who's up to their ears in source. Turn that surplus magical energy into good old fashioned rotational force!"]
	quest.79868B2EFE3FD0C6.title: "Wolf"
	quest.7AA5330EAA530248.quest_desc: [
		"Having trouble finding these? I know a guy."
		"Don't know what this is? Come back when you're a little more colorful, kid."
	]
	quest.7AA5330EAA530248.title: "Quitoxic Reeds"
	quest.7B74358AC24F0E0B.title: "Random Uncommon Hat"
	quest.7C2DC75DD401F259.quest_desc: [
		"All manner of fermented drinks could be yours."
		""
		"The keg is meant to be used with Create, to automate brewing, tapping, and pouring the resulting drink into tankards."
	]
	quest.7C2DC75DD401F259.title: "Cheers!"
	quest.7E2E47D7A085C39F.quest_desc: [
		"Hi, Peter Olle here. "
		""
		"I'm not gonna sugarcoat it. Things are bleak. The Shitsco empire is crumbling."
		""
		"The company coffers are empty. Despite our incredible track record of business success, my assistants claim that one of the following business choices MAY have \"ruined our company finances\":"
		"- Purchasing 'AI-Powered Designer Dog Beds' for every room of the Shitsco Mansion"
		"- Plating every single one of my morning corn flakes with a one millimeter layer of gold"
		"- Funding a research team to \"really get to the bottom of this Bigfoot business\""
		"- Engaging in a protracted legal battle with the postal service over the price of stamps"
		"- Digging a big hole in the ground, pouring cash into it, and lighting it on fire to \"see what happens\""
		""
		"Regardless of the cause, we're broke. It's down to you to fix this. We need you to establish new bases of industry and try to get some cash flowing back in. And hey, while you're at it, maybe think up some new product ideas? Folks love the MEAT INGOT, maybe we can do another one of those?"
		""
		"You're my only hope."
		""
		"Peter Olle"
		"Shitsco Inc. CEO"
	]
	quest.7E2E47D7A085C39F.title: "An actual note from the CEO"
	quest.7ED269387070650D.quest_desc: ["My buddy tells me he's a master taxidermist. He can put together a dragon head that's just as good as the real thing!"]
	quest.7ED269387070650D.title: "Dragon Head"
	quest.7F17371FB1E76EC9.title: "Bones"
	quest.7F6B59C11F1F371C.quest_desc: ["Make an attempt to defeat the Moonlit Masses, ending the night with an encounter with a Mutant Enderman."]
	quest.7F6B59C11F1F371C.quest_subtitle: "Fight Endermen"
	quest.7F6B59C11F1F371C.title: "Moonlit Masses"
	reward_table.09D103F3C92EE2B5.title: "Croptopia Seeds L-Z"
	reward_table.1AEBA9B4199DC867.title: "Stones"
